 "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Why You’ll Love It </strong></span></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Softness so indulgent, you’ll order room service at home. Our new Luxe Sateen Sheets are made with luxier upgrades like an increased thread count and 100% long-staple cotton for durability and breathability; a unique 4-over-1 weave pattern that’s soft as buttah’; and a silky-smooth, secret-finish softness you can’t get anywhere else but in bed with us. </span></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How It Feels</strong></span></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Luxuriously soft, breathable, and smooth like buttah’</span><b></b></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>How It Looks</strong></span></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Indulgent &amp; inviting, with a beautiful drape over your bed &amp; body </span><b></b></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Best For</strong></span></p>\n <p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Year-round comfort for most sleepers in four-season climates </span><b></b></p>\n <p role=\"presentation\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Details</strong></span></p>\n <ul>\n<p>Thread count: 480</p><p>Material: 100% long-staple cotton</p>",
